Project Objectives
Help shop owners manage their stock.
Provide advice on when to reorder products.
Reduce overstocking and stock shortages.
Support better shop-management decisions.
Help small retailers improve business operations.
Technologies Used
Python
Google Gemini API
Gradio
Google Colab
GitHub
How It Works
A user enters a shop-management question.
The application sends the question to Google's Gemini AI.
Gemini generates a response.
The application displays practical advice to the user.
Example Questions
How can I manage my shop stock?
When should I reorder sugar?
How can I avoid overstocking?
How can I increase profits in my shop?
